      "extract": "By (1.8) the q-Hermite polynomials Hn(x, s|q) are the moments of the measure of the or- thogonal polynomials Pn(z) satisfying the recurrence: Pn+1(z) = (z −xqn)Pn(z) + s[n]qPn−1(z). (2.1) Recall [13, p.80] that the Al-Salam-Chihara polynomials Qn(x) := Qn(x; α, β) satisfy the three term recurrence: Qn+1(x) = (2x −(α + β)qn)Qn(x) −(1 −qn)(1 −αβqn−1)Qn−1(x), (2.2) with Q0(x) = 1 and Q−1(x) = 0. They have the following",
