      "extract": "By definition \\eqref{eq:H2} and \\eqref{eq:ACR} we have \\begin{align} h_{n+1}(x,s;q)=q^nx h_n(x,s;q)-[n]_q s h_{n-1}(x,s;q). \\end{align} We derive then \\begin{align} h_n(x,s;q)&=q^{n\\choose 2}\\sqrt{s^n} \\tilde h_n\\left(\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{s}};q\\right)\\\\ &=\\sum_{k=0}^nq^{n-2k\\choose 2}{n\\brack 2k}[2k-1]_q!! (-s)^k x^{n-2k}, \\end{align} where $\\tilde h_n(x;q)$ are the discrete $q$-Hermite polynomials II, see \\eqref{eq:H2}.",
