      "extract": "onal polynomials (see [2, 18, 17]). Let pn(x) be a sequence of polynomials which satisﬁes the three term recurrence relation pn+1(x) = (x −bn)pn(x) −λnpn−1(x) (5.1) with initial values p0(x) = 1 and p−1(x) = 0. Deﬁne the coeﬃcients a(n, k) (0 ≤k ≤n) by n X k=0 a(n, k)pk(x) = xn. (5.2) These are characterized by the Stieltjes tableau: a(0, k) = δk,0, a(n, 0) = b0a(n −1, 0) + λ1a(n −1, 1), a(n, k) = a(n −1, k −1) +",
